      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A system that adds up to 4 hidden enchants to the RWC Memorial Ring and the RWC Memorial Pendant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Like Fallen Angel Wings, it is an enchant for expensive equipment with few real enchant chances."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Enchant Order",
      "anchor": "order"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Enchant Order",
      "text": "Enchants go in slot order 4 → 3 → 2 → 1."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Equipment with a created socket can only be enchanted in slots 4 → 3 → 2."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Socket Enchant",
      "anchor": "socket"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The Socket Enchant turns the RWC Memorial Ring and Pendant into the [ITEM:2967|RWC Memorial Ring [1]] and the [ITEM:2969|RWC Memorial Pendant [1]]."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Entry",
        "Details"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Success Rate",
          "50%"
        ],
        [
          "On Failure",
          "Equipment destroyed"
        ],
        [
          "Restriction",
          "Not available for equipment with a hidden enchant"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Hidden Enchant",
      "anchor": "hidden"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "You choose the option type for each slot; the option value is random."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Destruction Chance",
      "text": "Enchanting slot 1 or 2 destroys the equipment with a 25% chance."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "No Reset",
      "text": "An applied enchant cannot be reset, but a [ITEM:6665|RWC Enchant Reset Ticket] resets the enchants once."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Ring Enchant",
      "anchor": "ring"
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "headers": [
        "Slot",
        "Available Options"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Slots 3~4",
          "Fighting Spirit, ATK%, MHP%, HP"
        ],
        [
          "Slots 1~2",
          "STR, AGI, VIT, INT, DEX, LUK, SP"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Main options: Fighting Spirit Lv 1~3, ATK +1~3%, MHP +1~3%, HP +100~300"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Pendant Enchant",
      "anchor": "pendant"
    },
    {
